.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-locked-tower-2022-08-12#:~:text=%22I%20concealed%20it%20in,of%20Trokair%2C%20on%20Sarpadia.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Episode 3: The Locked Tower","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Langley Hyde"],"date":"2022-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-locked-tower-2022-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-locked-tower-2022-08-12#:~:text=%22I%20concealed%20it%20in,of%20Trokair%2C%20on%20Sarpadia.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Episode 3: The Locked Tower\" by Langley Hyde. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Aug 2022."}},{"id":"episode-3-locked-tower-2022-08-12-e11","summary":"Stenn is revealed as a Phyrexian sleeper agent who transforms himself into an antenna and transmits the false location to Sheoldred.","participants":["stenn","sheoldred","karn","powerstone"],"location":"new-argive-s-watchtower","importance":"major","page":"stories/episode-3-locked-tower-2022-08-12","order":467,"story_date":"2022-08-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":181,"quote":"He had converted his entire body into an antenna, Karn realized","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-locked-tower-2022-08-12#:~:text=He%20had%20converted%20his,an%20antenna%2C%20Karn%20realized","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Episode 3: The Locked Tower","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Langley Hyde"],"date":"2022-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-locked-tower-2022-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-locked-tower-2022-08-12#:~:text=He%20had%20converted%20his,an%20antenna%2C%20Karn%20realized","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Episode 3: The Locked Tower\" by Langley Hyde. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Aug 2022."}},{"id":"episode-3-locked-tower-2022-08-12-e